{
  "duration": 87.22,
  "phrases": [
    {
      "start": 0.099,
      "end": 1.5,
      "text": "So welcome back again."
    },
    {
      "start": 2.18,
      "end": 3.659,
      "text": "Time for one more problem."
    },
    {
      "start": 4.319,
      "end": 5.059,
      "text": "Now, in this problem,"
    },
    {
      "start": 5.559,
      "end": 6.399,
      "text": "we are given that"
    },
    {
      "start": 6.839,
      "end": 7.699,
      "text": "two delivery vans"
    },
    {
      "start": 8.079,
      "end": 9.5,
      "text": "start from the same depot."
    },
    {
      "start": 10.159,
      "end": 13.199,
      "text": "The speed of the first delivery van is"
    },
    {
      "start": 13.639,
      "end": 15.039,
      "text": "thirty-eight kilometer"
    },
    {
      "start": 15.579,
      "end": 16.02,
      "text": "per hour."
    },
    {
      "start": 16.619,
      "end": 18.159,
      "text": "The speed of the second delivery van"
    },
    {
      "start": 18.739,
      "end": 21.459,
      "text": "is forty-seven kilometer per hour."
    },
    {
      "start": 22.0,
      "end": 24.059,
      "text": "Both vans move in opposite directions."
    },
    {
      "start": 24.379,
      "end": 32.799,
      "text": "The question is asking us to find after how many hours they will be two hundred fifty-five kilometer apart. Now, let us understand one important concept."
    },
    {
      "start": 33.2,
      "end": 35.54,
      "text": "When two objects move in opposite directions,"
    },
    {
      "start": 36.0,
      "end": 37.659,
      "text": "the distance between them keeps increasing."
    },
    {
      "start": 38.279,
      "end": 38.819,
      "text": "Every hour,"
    },
    {
      "start": 39.279,
      "end": 41.5,
      "text": "the first van moves thirty-eight"
    },
    {
      "start": 41.84,
      "end": 42.559,
      "text": "kilometer."
    },
    {
      "start": 43.099,
      "end": 43.979,
      "text": "At the same time,"
    },
    {
      "start": 44.439,
      "end": 46.839,
      "text": "the second van moves forty-seven kilometer."
    },
    {
      "start": 47.399,
      "end": 54.819,
      "text": "So after one hour, the distance between them increases by thirty-eight plus forty-seven, that is eighty-five kilometer."
    },
    {
      "start": 55.299,
      "end": 57.819,
      "text": "This is called the relative speed."
    },
    {
      "start": 58.219,
      "end": 61.499,
      "text": "So relative speed is equal to thirty-eight plus forty-seven."
    },
    {
      "start": 61.979,
      "end": 64.199,
      "text": "That gives us eighty-five kilometer per hour."
    },
    {
      "start": 64.72,
      "end": 65.179,
      "text": "Got it?"
    },
    {
      "start": 65.68,
      "end": 66.119,
      "text": "Perfect."
    },
    {
      "start": 66.439,
      "end": 67.439,
      "text": "Now we need to find the time."
    },
    {
      "start": 67.979,
      "end": 68.839,
      "text": "We know the formula."
    },
    {
      "start": 69.339,
      "end": 72.86,
      "text": "Time is equal to distance divided by relative speed,"
    },
    {
      "start": 73.439,
      "end": 75.979,
      "text": "which is two hundred fifty-five divided by eighty-five."
    },
    {
      "start": 76.419,
      "end": 77.659,
      "text": "After simplifying this,"
    },
    {
      "start": 77.979,
      "end": 79.059,
      "text": "we get three hours."
    },
    {
      "start": 79.4,
      "end": 84.4,
      "text": "So after three hours, the two delivery vans will be two hundred fifty-five kilometer apart."
    },
    {
      "start": 84.779,
      "end": 87.22,
      "text": "Hence, the correct answer is option A."
    }
  ],
